#4471 was marked known, as one parser bug. The desk’s own table is the count, from the export, one row per report id.

The shared parser reads a day-first date month first. That cause is this ticket.

booking-v3 prints `MM/DD/YYYY` under the date field and then reads the field day first. Those reports were merged into #4471. They are a second problem, and they have no ticket of their own.

A few reports were read as a one-day move. The desk still counts them under the cause their tenant files them in.

